      "summary": "By pressing the 'I AM OF LEGAL AGE' button, I agree that I am of legal age for smoking and drinking in my country. Quesada Cigars is undergoing a period of transition and transformation under the leadership of Raquel and Patricia Quesada—a shift that inevitably brings a new style better suited to the times. At Intertabac 2026, Raquel Quesada focused on welcoming international distributors to unveil the rebranding of the company’s most iconic line, Casa Magna, across all its versions: Colorado, Liga F, and Maduro. The new design is modern and fresh, yet it clearly conveys continuity through its conceptual clarity and, above all, respect for the brand's legacy.",
